.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# prisma
# NOTE: /prisma/migrations is intentionally NOT ignored — this project has
# been running on `prisma db push` (schema pushed directly, no migration
# history), which means `npm run db:migrate` (`prisma migrate deploy`) has
# never actually applied anything. To fix this, run ONCE against your real
# database (see prisma/manual-migrations/003_baseline_instructions.md):
#   npx prisma migrate dev --name baseline
# then commit the generated prisma/migrations/ folder. After that, use
# `prisma migrate dev` for schema changes instead of `db push`.
/prisma/*.db

